                        <p>
                            At Happy Event Group & Wedding Planner, we value your privacy and are committed to protecting the personal information you share with us. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store, and safeguard your information when you visit our website or use our event planning services.
                        </p>

                        <h5>Information We Collect</h5>
                        <p>We may collect the following information when you contact us or use our services:</p>
