                            <li>Phone Number</li>
                            <li>Email Address</li>
                            <li>Event Details (Date, Venue, Budget, Requirements)</li>
                            <li>Billing Information (if applicable)</li>
                            <li>Any information you voluntarily provide through forms, WhatsApp, email, or phone calls.</li>
                        </ul>

                        <h5>How We Use Your Information</h5>
                        <p>Your information is used to:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Respond to your inquiries and provide quotations.</li>
                            <li>Respond to your inquiries and provide quotations.</li>
                            <li>Confirm bookings and communicate important updates.</li>
                            <li>Improve our services and customer experience.</li>
                            <li>Send promotional offers, event updates, or newsletters (only if you choose to receive them).</li>
                            <li>Comply with legal and regulatory requirements.</li>
                        </ul>


                        <h5>Information Sharing</h5>
                        <p>We respect your privacy and do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information.</p>
                        <p>Your information may only be shared with:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Trusted vendors or service partners involved in your event.</li>
                            <li>Payment processing providers (where applicable).</li>
                            <li>Government authorities if required by law.</li>

                        </ul>



                        <h5>Data Security</h5>
                        <p>We implement appropriate technical and organizational security measures to protect your personal information from unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or misuse. While we strive to use commercially acceptable methods to safeguard your data, no internet transmission is completely secure.</p>


