                            <li>Analyze visitor traffic.</li>
                            <li>Remember user preferences.</li>
                            <li>Enhance your browsing experience.</li>

                        </ul>
                        <p>You can disable cookies through your browser settings, although some features of the website may not function properly.</p>


                        <h5>Third-Party Links</h5>
                        <p>Our website may contain links to third-party websites, including social media platforms. We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of these external websites. We encourage users to review their privacy policies before providing personal information.</p>
                        
                        

